    "text": "<blockquote><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/568f625d-f7f2-458e-aa1a-d05a04b855e8-image.png\" /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0.01</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p></blockquote><blockquote><p>now at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p></blockquote><blockquote><p>at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mtext>&#160;s</mtext></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-